 pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Butter in the microwave.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a8/Butter_in_the_microwave..png/revision/latest?cb=20210321093643\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Butter in the microwave.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a8/Butter_in_the_microwave..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210321093643\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a8/Butter_in_the_microwave..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210321093643 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a8/Butter_in_the_microwave..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210321093643 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Butter in the microwave.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Butter_in_the_microwave..png\" data-image-name=\"Butter in the microwave..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\">9</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Gamble\" title=\"Ed Gamble\">Ed Gamble</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Join_our_cult.\" title=\"Join our cult.\">Join our cult.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Five_miles_per_day.\" title=\"Five miles per day.\">Five miles per day.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Butter in the microwave.</b></i> is the second episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\">Series 9</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 11 September 2019. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Gamble\" title=\"Ed Gamble\">Ed Gamble</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Butter_in_the_microwave.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Butter in the microwave\" was a phrase uttered by <a href=\"/wiki/David_Baddiel\" title=\"David Baddiel\">David Baddiel</a>, when answering questions about his team's performance in the <a href=\"/wiki/Say_the_word_demeaning\" title=\"Say the word demeaning\">Say the word demeaning</a> task. The pencil in the title card comes from the <a href=\"/wiki/Draw_a_portrait_of_the_Taskmaster_using_16_A1_pages\" title=\"Draw a portrait of the Taskmaster using 16 A1 pages\">Draw a portrait of the Taskmaster using 16 A1 pages</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Butter_in_the_microwave.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Smør i mikroovnen', which translates as 'Butter in the microwave'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Voita mikrouunissa', which translates as 'Butter in the microwave'.</li>\n<li>On New Zealand's TVNZ+ streaming platform, this episode is titled 'The Gobblers'. Alex refers to the team of David Baddiel and Jo Brand as \"The Gobblers\" during the scoring for the <a href=\"/wiki/Say_the_word_demeaning\" title=\"Say the word demeaning\">Say the word demeaning</a> task, after Greg refers to them as the \"Cheese Sandwich Gobbling Old People\".</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Smør i mikrobølgeovnen', which translates as 'Butter in the microwave'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Butter_in_the_microwave.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/David_Baddiel\" title=\"David Baddiel\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">David Baddiel</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Gamble\" title=\"Ed Gamble\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ed Gamble</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jo_Brand\" title=\"Jo Brand\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jo Brand</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Katy_Wix\" title=\"Katy Wix\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Katy Wix</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rose_Matafeo\" title=\"Rose Matafeo\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rose Matafeo</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_bag\" title=\"Best bag\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best bag.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Correctly_identify_which_bin_Alex_is_in\" title=\"Correctly identify which bin Alex is in\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Correctly identify which bin Alex is in. You must adhere to the commandments behind the curtain. You may only have one guess. No bins are to be opened at any point during the task unless authorised.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Draw_a_portrait_of_the_Taskmaster_using_16_A1_pages\" title=\"Draw a portrait of the Taskmaster using 16 A1 pages\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Draw a portrait of the Taskmaster using 16 A1 pages. You may not remove the A1 pages from the flipchart during your drawing. After the task, the A1 pages will be laid out in the pattern shown on the front page. You may only draw on the flipchart paper.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Say_the_word_demeaning\" title=\"Say the word demeaning\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Complete this adventure (by saying the word demeaning). Unless otherwise stated, you must stick together and only open one task when you've completed the previous one.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_lovely_little_ball_arrangement\" title=\"Make a lovely little ball arrangement\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Make a lovely little ball arrangement.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Live:</b> Flatten all of the yellow balls, throw all the red balls into the bucket, and turn all the blue balls into one big blue ball.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">19\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Butter_in_the_microwave.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow no